# UBSan suppressions for the sanitizer CI job (UBSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=...).
#
# OCCT's own mesher (BRepMesh_NodeInsertionMeshAlgo::initDataStructure -> TopoDS::Face, TopoDS_Shape::TShape) reads a
# TopoDS_Shape at an address that is only 4-byte aligned.  Every frame of the reports is inside OCCT; the first frame of
# ours is the call to BRepMesh_IncrementalMesh (src/io/mesh.cpp).  Only the alignment check, only for code that comes
# from OCCT's headers: the same check stays on for this repository's own code.  (The first run named TopoDS.hxx, the
# next TopoDS_Shape.hxx: the same read, so the whole header directory is covered.)
alignment:*/opencascade/*
